  "changes": [
    "Use Alpha root-scope useSessionPendingInteraction separately from useSessions, counting only session IDs still in the session list and updating on pending-only changes.",
    "Replace removed client-runtime injection with the official ui-renderer and ui-session prerequisites; use Cordis Context in the public type declaration.",
    "Replace hand-written JSX-runtime calls with React.createElement so both count pills and their numeric text are actual children.",
    "Dispose title and favicon mutations plus the hidden theme-color probe, suppress late fetch writes after unmount, and preserve existing favicon elements including those without an href.",
    "Preserve the upstream MIT license, source identity, click-through display, and local-only favicon request. No runtime dependencies or package lifecycle scripts are added."
  ],
